Z||000000||lennyb4||04-07-2000||01:33 PM||||News Flash....Lenny chalks up a nother confirmed kill. Coming back from lunch today a nissan 200SX :P was feeling a little froggy. This car was the perfect example of a ricer. Low/fat tires that stuck out the sides, 3" exaust, big,big spoiler, etc. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">.Well back to the story..Were sitting at a red light, it turns green and off we go..my little iron duke tore him up..And to top it all off..all of a sudden i hear this BOOM and he starts spewin' oil and smoke everywhere  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">. Hey what can i say but "dont mess with FIERO's".. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
